  "title": "Nimble Fermented Egyptian Reblochon Salad",
  "description": "A light and refreshing lacto-vegetarian salad featuring fermented reblochon cheese, fresh Egyptian herbs, and a tangy brine.",
  "cuisine": "Egyptian",
