  "instructions": [
    "In a small bowl, whisk together lemon juice and olive oil to make a vinaigrette.",
    "In a large bowl, combine reblochon cheese, olives, parsley, cilantro, and garlic.",
    "Drizzle the vinaigrette over the cheese mixture and toss to combine.",
    "Season with salt to taste.",
    "Cover the bowl with plastic wrap and refrigerate for at least 30 minutes to allow the flavors to meld.",
    "Just before serving, give the salad a good stir and adjust the seasoning if needed.",
    "Transfer the salad to a talavera plate and serve chilled.",
    "Garnish with additional parsley or cilantro if desired."
  ],
